300 nodes, ring lattice of degree 4, 20 ticks of rewiring

                          edges   clustering    path length
ring lattice                600         0.50           37.9
p = 0.001                   600         0.47           14.2
p = 0.005                   600         0.44            9.2
p = 0.020                   598         0.32            6.0
